WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:17.135
Peter hopped through the woods.

2
00:00:17.136 --> 00:00:28.472
A path led to the farmer's gate.

3
00:00:28.473 --> 00:00:36.672
Peter squeezed under the gate and looked around.

4
00:00:36.673 --> 00:00:51.177
"I see green leaves everywhere!" said Peter.

5
00:00:51.178 --> 00:00:59.535
Peter wandered through the garden.

6
00:00:59.536 --> 00:01:02.133
He ate some lettuce.

7
00:01:02.134 --> 00:01:13.209
He ate some green beans.

8
00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:20.632
He ate some radishes.

9
00:01:20.633 --> 00:01:25.334
"These vegetables are delicious!" said Peter.

10
00:01:25.335 --> 00:01:31.586
"I'll eat some more."

11
00:01:31.587 --> 00:01:37.006
Then he hopped around a corner.

12
00:01:37.007 --> 00:01:40.924
Peter gasped. "The farmer!"

13
00:01:40.925 --> 00:01:45.544
The farmer gasped. "A rabbit!"

14
00:01:45.545 --> 00:01:47.533
Peter ran.

15
00:01:47.534 --> 00:01:51.268
The farmer grabbed his rake.

16
00:01:51.269 --> 00:01:55.815
He chased Peter.

17
00:01:55.816 --> 00:01:59.834
"Stop, thief!" cried the farmer.

18
00:01:59.835 --> 00:02:02.620
He swung his rake at Peter.

19
00:02:02.621 --> 00:02:05.814
Peter ran as fast as he could.

20
00:02:05.815 --> 00:02:10.626
His heart beat fast.

21
00:02:10.627 --> 00:02:19.147
He lost one shoe near the cabbages.

22
00:02:19.148 --> 00:02:25.007
He lost his other shoe near the potatoes.

23
00:02:25.008 --> 00:02:28.334
"Where's the gate?" cried Peter.

24
00:02:28.335 --> 00:02:32.731
He looked around.

25
00:02:32.732 --> 00:02:35.821
Suddenly he ran into a net.

26
00:02:35.822 --> 00:02:39.268
The big buttons on his jacket got caught.

27
00:02:39.269 --> 00:02:42.624
"Ahh!" cried Peter.

28
00:02:42.625 --> 00:02:46.922
He kicked and twisted.

29
00:02:46.923 --> 00:02:49.557
But it was no help.

30
00:02:49.558 --> 00:02:58.466
"I'm stuck in the farmer's net!" cried Peter.
